  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "A soft, soothing murmur calmed the crying baby.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "His low, gentle voice dropped almost to a whisper.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her thick, choked voice caught in her throat.",
      "vibe": "Lonely"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her warm, comforting words wrapped around him like a blanket.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "She crooned a lullaby until the small fists uncurled.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"It will pass,\" he whispered in her ear.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "His shaky, unsteady voice trembled with emotion.",
      "vibe": "Lonely"
    },
    {
      "text": "A quiet, anxious question hung in the air.",
      "vibe": "General"
    },
    {
      "text": "She hushed the frightened child and rocked him.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "She coaxed him gently down from the tree.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "His voice cracked on the last word.",
      "vibe": "Lonely"
    },
    {
      "text": "She sighed with sympathy and took his hand.",
      "vibe": "General"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'll stay,\" she promised softly.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "His voice softened at once.",
      "vibe": "General"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sweet, false sympathy dripped from every word.",
      "vibe": "Menacing"
    },
    {
      "text": "A bright, encouraging voice cheered them on from the gate.",
      "vibe": "Lively"
    },
    {
      "text": "A fierce, urgent whisper hissed across the room: \"Leave her alone.\"",
      "vibe": "Wild"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"There now,\" came a tender, husky whisper in the dark.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"How dare you,\" she said, and her voice shook with protective fury.",
      "vibe": "Wild"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I'm so sorry,\" he said, and faltered.",
      "vibe": "Lonely"
    },
    {
      "text": "She tried to speak, but only a sob came.",
      "vibe": "Lonely"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Poor thing,\" he said, in a tone that meant nothing of the kind.",
      "vibe": "Menacing"
    },
    {
      "text": "He murmured and soothed until the horse stood quiet.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"You did your best,\" she reassured him, and meant it.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "He hummed under his breath as he bandaged the paw.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Does it hurt?\" she asked, with a long, heartfelt sigh.",
      "vibe": "General"
    },
    {
      "text": "She spoke in a patient, coaxing tone, as one speaks to a frightened animal.",
      "vibe": "General"
    },
    {
      "text": "\"You can do it!\" they called, and their voices carried her up the last steps.",
      "vibe": "Lively"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her voice was as soft as a hand on the forehead.",
      "vibe": "Beautiful"
    },
    {
      "text": "She comforted him in a silence that was kinder than words.",
      "vibe": "Peaceful"
    }
  ]
